    "metadata": {
      "name": "EventGraph",
      "description": "A Gate opened by a condition lets only the later loop iterations through.",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "created_at": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z",
      "modified_at": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z"
    },
    "comments": [
      {
        "id": "comment-1",
        "text": "GATE\n\nA Gate lets execution through only while it is open. Its Open and Close inputs are checked every\ntime the Gate is triggered. Here a For Loop triggers it five times; the gate is told to open once\nthe running count reaches 3, so only the last three triggers pass (passed ends at 3).",
        "position": [
          60.0,
          -300.0
        ],
        "size": [
          900.0,
          210.0
        ],
        "color": [
          0.2,
          0.4,
          0.8,
          0.3
        ],
        "contained_node_ids": []
      },
      {
        "id": "comment-2",
        "text": "COUNT\nEach iteration first increments i (1, 2, 3, 4, 5).",
        "position": [
          660.0,
          460.0
        ],
        "size": [
          520.0,
          90.0
        ],
        "color": [
          0.2,
          0.65,
          0.35,
          0.3
        ],
        "contained_node_ids": [
          "gi",
          "plus",
          "si"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "comment-3",
        "text": "OPEN CONDITION\ni >= 3 is wired into Gate.Open. From the third trigger on the gate is open (and stays open, because nothing closes it).",
        "position": [
          960.0,
          800.0
        ],
        "size": [
          640.0,
          110.0
        ],
        "color": [
          0.9,
          0.55,
          0.15,
          0.3
        ],
        "contained_node_ids": [
          "gi2",
          "reached",
          "gate"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "comment-4",
        "text": "PASSED\nOnly triggers that get through the Gate reach this increment: i = 3, 4, 5, so passed = 3.",
        "position": [
          1560.0,
          120.0
        ],
        "size": [
